caption: Tradition Paths
tradition-component: tradition-paths

When a character first gains Shadow Arts, choose one Shadow Arts Path. The choice costs no character points, is mutually exclusive, and cannot be retrained, abandoned, or combined through ordinary advancement. A Path applies to every legal Jutsu the character uses when its text says so, not merely to Jutsu from the character's current Shadow Arts tree.
